      ],
      "inconsistency_hints": [
        "The trigger allows selecting either the Customer History Page or the Auction Customer RFM Report, but the main flow only continues the RFM report selection. The Customer History Page is also an excluded adjacent action in the goal, so the trigger introduces a branch that is not handled by the main flow or postconditions.",
        "Postcondition 2 claims the report displays data split into tiers for Recency, Frequency, and Monetary. Main Flow step 6 only explicitly states that the Recency section is split into six tiers; it does not establish that Frequency and Monetary sections have tiers. Evidence EC-PO-003 is noted as only supporting Recency tiers, so the universal tier claim for all three sections is not reachable from the main flow.",
        "Postcondition 3 states that each tier displays calculated fields including '% Tot Accts'. Main Flow step 6 only specifies these fields for the Recency section, and the noted evidence indicates the Grand Total row at the bottom of each section does not contain a value for '% Tot Accts'. The universal quantifier 'Each tier' is therefore not supported by the main flow or evidence."
      ]
    }
  ],
